brand new version focuses on an immersive, mixed reality experience.\n\n(m)ORPH is not a game, but lets players interact with spatial audio in real-time to create a dynamically evolving music environment. Immersive sound objects and abstract, audio-reactive visuals are all around your room, yielding an 360-degree experience that you get to control and explore. Morph was a 3rd place winner in the Meta Start Developers competition in 2025.\n\n# Musical Artists\n- Freezepop ~ \"Swimming Pool\"\n- Kodomo ~ \"Light Rain\"\n- Yumi Iwaki ~ \"Residual Echo\"\n- Tawnylawns ~ \"Easy Work\"\n- Khems ~ \"Forest Bathing\"\n- Dispak ~ \"Koshkina\"\n- Symbion Project ~ \"Nodus Tollens\" ft Mars Nord\n- ELYXR ~ \"Strange Stubborn Proud\" ft Kurt Larson\n- The JD's ~ \"Proust\"\n- Rocococo ~ \"Reject the Data\"", "short_description": "(m)ORPH Mixed is a mixed reality music experience for Meta Quest 3/3s created by audio technologist Kasson Crooker. (m)ORPH is not a game, but lets players interact with music in real-time to create a dynamically evolving sonic environment. Immersive sound objects and abstract, audio-reactive visuals are all around your room, yielding an 360-degree experience that you get to control and explore. The Morph app is free and comes with 2 songs and a small fee to unlock the rest of the songs."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.speedofdarkmusic.com/morph-mixed-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Speed of Dark Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.speedofdarkmusic.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recomme